description=Container sorting, supply planning and a versioned supply API for separate mods. Requires B47ANCEDRooms (Workshop item 3820077442) for room designation and delegated room policies. Both area scopes include full carried inventory and configured physical storage. Permissions are enforced at supported server integration checks, not unrelated vanilla actions. Obsolete B47 sorting formats/category rules are removed on authority; native rules, item selections, priorities and owned presets are retained. Back up saves before upgrading. Vanilla categories when used alone. Optional Better Sorting (BetterSortCC), Better Containers (EURY_CONTAINERS / REORDER_CONTAINERS) or Extended Categories (CAExtendedCategories) use native categories. Better Containers and Extended Categories category selections save explicit item choices; reselect after category membership changes. Follow each category mod's compatibility rules. Disable original Quartermaster (Quartermaster) and older B47 sorting copies. Development build: server-validated Dangerous Load preference and bounded read-only content analysis. Supply Ledger remains an isolated prototype, not enabled gameplay. The shelf appearance experiment is out of scope. Dedicated multiplayer NOT TESTED for this iteration.
